              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लांबणीवर टाकणे — lāmbṇīvar ṭākṇe — \"to postpone\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पावसामुळे पंचांनी सामना लांबणीवर टाकला. pāvsāmuḷe pañcānnī sāmnā lāmbṇīvar ṭāklā. Because of the rain the umpires postponed the match."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने बैठक लांबणीवर टाकली, tyāne baiṭhak lāmbṇīvar ṭāklī."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Literally to put on the long side."
            }
          ]
        },
