              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तडीस नेणे — taḍīs neṇe — \"to see through; to complete\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पैसे कमी होते, तरी त्याने योजना तडीस नेली. paise kamī hote, tarī tyāne yojnā taḍīs nelī. Money was short, but he saw the plan through."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने काम तडीस नेलं, tyāne kām taḍīs nelaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Literally to take it to the shore: तड is a bank."
            }
          ]
        },
