              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तडीस नेणे (taḍīs neṇe) is तडीस, \"to the bank\", built on तड, which is inherited from Sanskrit taṭa, \"slope, shore\" (CDIAL 5629), with नेणे, \"to take\"."
